---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Corrections | DigiPlain" description="Report an outdated step or factual error in a DigiPlain guide.">
  <section class="page-hero container"><span class="eyebrow">Corrections</span><h1>Found a step that changed?</h1><p>Interfaces, USSD codes and online processes can change. We want our guides to change with them.</p></section>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top:20px"><div class="reading article-body"><h2>What to send</h2><p>Please include the page URL, the step or statement that appears wrong, what you saw instead, and—when possible—the official source or a screenshot that confirms the change.</p><h2>How corrections work</h2><p>We review the report, verify the new information, update the article where necessary, and change the article's updated or verified date when the revision is substantive.</p><p>Use the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> to submit a correction.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
